      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.98,
      "end_seconds": 3.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "hi doctor am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.36,
      "end_seconds": 10.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "Right, yes, come in and sit down. What brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.23,
      "end_seconds": 16.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "Um, so... very heavy periods. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.24,
      "end_seconds": 21.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "what do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.18,
      "end_seconds": 28.34,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "I take Eltroxin, 100 micrograms, every morning for my thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.84,
      "end_seconds": 32.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "sure. Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.87,
      "end_seconds": 35.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "about... well two months"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.4,
      "end_seconds": 40.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.13,
      "end_seconds": 58.09,
      "duration_seconds": 15.96,
      "text": "it usually comes with periods lasting longer. Oh, and cramping pain in the lower tummy. Had that that since Friday. About cramping pain in the lower tummy, it's a few times a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.65,
      "end_seconds": 59.46,
      "duration_seconds": 0.81,
      "text": "mm-hmm"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.57,
      "end_seconds": 65.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "The periods lasting longer? That's been for two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.81,
      "end_seconds": 72.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "And what about weight loss or vaginal discharge?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.53,
      "end_seconds": 77.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "none of those, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.37,
      "end_seconds": 82.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "have you had any pain during sex or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.88,
      "end_seconds": 87.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "no, I haven't had any of them"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.88,
      "end_seconds": 92.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Anything with your heart like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.32,
      "end_seconds": 96.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "no that's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.47,
      "end_seconds": 100.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.15,
      "end_seconds": 103.14,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.05,
      "end_seconds": 107.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "what line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.71,
      "end_seconds": 113.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.28,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.88,
      "end_seconds": 121.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.02,
      "end_seconds": 127.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.92,
      "end_seconds": 131.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.58,
      "end_seconds": 136.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.91,
      "end_seconds": 143.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.1,
      "end_seconds": 155.49,
      "duration_seconds": 10.39,
      "text": "I had a reaction to erythromycin when I was younger, bad stomach cramps, and I've avoided it it since."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.45,
      "end_seconds": 167.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.69,
      "end_seconds": 171.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "my father has Parkinson's disease"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.65,
      "end_seconds": 192.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.37,
      "end_seconds": 198.38,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "I have an underactive thyroid, for about ten years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.14,
      "end_seconds": 202.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "I follow any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.1,
      "end_seconds": 206.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "No, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.0,
      "end_seconds": 209.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.1,
      "end_seconds": 225.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.04,
      "end_seconds": 251.15,
      "duration_seconds": 9.11,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 36.7, BP is 122 over 68, heart rate 73, respiratory rate 16, saturation 98 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.0,
      "end_seconds": 257.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Okay now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.65,
      "end_seconds": 262.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Okay, stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.49,
      "end_seconds": 282.59,
      "duration_seconds": 7.1,
      "text": "the tummy is soft a little tender in the lower part and there's no mass"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.64,
      "end_seconds": 297.21,
      "duration_seconds": 10.57,
      "text": "you can relax now okay, thinking it through, I think we're dealing with heavy periods with a cause still to find at this stage"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.88,
      "end_seconds": 302.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "Let me think, I'm scared it's something bad. Is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.49,
      "end_seconds": 316.23,
      "duration_seconds": 11.74,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's heavy periods with a cause still to find, and we'll watch how it goes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.17,
      "end_seconds": 334.16,
      "duration_seconds": 6.99,
      "text": "for now no new medicines or tests are needed alright that's all from me any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 336.06,
      "end_seconds": 339.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "Thank you, you know, that's helpful."
